    "updated_at": "2020-06-26T11:24:37Z",
    "body": "Sure, but I don't get why the key needs to be in the document's \"list of available images\". Why is that desirable? For a given document, the origin is always the same, right? (maybe modulo `document.domain` shenanigans). If so I don't get how it is useful.",
